  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1204.56 Unclassifiable process or device",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1204.56 \"Unclassifiable process or device\" means a VOC-emitting process or device which does not meet the definitional criteria of at least one of the VOC categories listed in Env-A 1201.03(a)(1) through (21).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
